&_nc_oc=Adr36l5EJzIxel_udKQC41aWbfXVhmn5s4a4svcxzw5CxlyHdNN9_IKdX18h4jo8XfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKmDEyOA8cNpZutkoJ1I8PdXn-o767SHnk9MV-EWpMtyg&oe=6AA2C9BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fzxzWD5yO8YQ7kNvwFvSZI_&_nc_oc=Adok7D6E6qxua5ZixevCmtr01njybV0Hlq8Ck8PUZ25P5WlkQqyQhzLJnJ66NmKeNSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJJRHT_tMyDUa3ai7zRhNVlbA0P0IQkKF_oF6DyKAPofg&oe=6AA2A27C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-p14Bbeg4sUQ7kNvwEEQ6qo&_nc_oc=Adp2DCffH4sB9ST32zqxFo1WYude4fMqjc-fZwLMODVC1dT_gG7Ye_1RbU5R6wtxu_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ7Nwgiw6teiVCliHCwFdbxhZ9NHsy_-bMNmn2aI-0syg&oe=6AA2C107"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s353d_Yx_CAQ7kNvwHESOfW&_nc_oc=AdoWhWlZpX25qZFYDMKpq0qcOAyjDvusYuNqLO7shBE5LduwjceEGn-ZygvfnTrEbr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ0JbzHRn4UagbHuVg8InxbGMHE0xhNN-OdipDBe4Y2ZA&oe=6AA2ACD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ITfj0E8J3_kQ7kNvwG05Qlk&_nc_oc=Adr57FPbMfD9yu707HR3BloL6UQXO8J7XrvPF2FaWSqMrEwnPDjqQkuYl9QDdbRNkkE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKKyylp61kD4O6R3M3N1d5-HD9joqxi2M0V_c24UWVWPA&oe=6AA2B964"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.